<title>ITALY: Italian retail sales rose 2.5 pct in July yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italian retail sales rose 2.5 pct in July yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail sales of medium and large firms in Italy rose 2.5 percent year-on-year in July, national statistics institute ISTAT said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the retail sales index (1990=100) was 134.5 in July against 131.2 in the same 1995 month.</p>
<p>Retail sales in the first seven months of 1996 rose 5.8 percent compared to the same period last year</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678-2505</p>
